<title>UK: Guinness up on bullish press report.</title>
<headline>Guinness up on bullish press report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Guinness Plc were 12p to 458-1/2p by 0955 GMT on Monday, buoyed by a favourable press report over the weekend, dealers said.  </p>
<p>The Observer on Sunday said the shares looked cheap and forecasted a bounce back.</p>
<p>Shares in other major UK brewers rose amid hopes Tuesday's budget would contain concessions on alcohol duties, dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares in Bass Plc were up 7p to 814p, while shares in Whitbread climbed 7-1/2p to 755p.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
